<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer has over 91 pct of Highlands.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer has over 91 pct of Highlands.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placer Dome Inc said on Friday it had more than 91 percent of its takeover target Highlands Gold Ltd and had extended its offer for a week until February 15.</p>
<p>Placer Dome said its holdings includes a small proportion of legally binding undertakings. &quot;Once the undertakings are converted to formal acceptances, Placer Dome will be entitled to move to compulsory acquisition,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The Canadian gold miner is offering 75 cents per Highlands share.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
